@ref reg 4 (src:60-87)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of rows in the Table in regulation 4` MEANS count `the Table in regulation 4`

@ref reg 4 (src:60-87)
GIVEN citation IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`regulation 4 revokes the whole of the instrument cited as` citation MEANS
    any (GIVEN row YIELD (row's `citation` EQUALS citation) AND (row's `extent of revocation` EQUALS `the whole instrument`)) `the Table in regulation 4`

@ref reg 4 (src:60-87)
GIVEN citation IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`regulation 4 revokes part only of the instrument cited as` citation MEANS
    any (GIVEN row YIELD (row's `citation` EQUALS citation) AND (NOT (row's `extent of revocation` EQUALS `the whole instrument`))) `the Table in regulation 4`
